<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
 <title>Platform Settings — ONBOARD3 Admin</title>
 <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="a-bg"></div>
<%- include('../partials/nav', { page:'platform-settings', admin:user }) %>

<div class="a-main">
 <div class="a-content" style="max-width:800px">
 <div class="a-page-header">
 <div>
 <h1><i class="fas fa-sliders"></i> Platform Settings</h1>
 <p>Apeit wallet URL, withdrawal minimums, and fee tiers</p>
 </div>
 </div>

 <% if (typeof query !== 'undefined') { %>
 <% if (query.saved) { %>
 <div style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.1);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,.3);border-radius:8px;padding:.875rem 1rem;color:#6ee7b7;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Settings saved.</div>
 <% } else if (query.error) { %>
 <div style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.3);border-radius:8px;padding:.875rem 1rem;color:#f87171;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem"><i class="fas fa-circle-xmark"></i> Error saving. Please try again.</div>
 <% } %>
 <% } %>

 <form method="POST" action="/admin/platform-settings">

 <!-- ── Apeit Wallet ── -->
 <div class="a-card" style="animation-delay:0ms">
 <div class="a-card-header"><h2><i class="fas fa-wallet"></i> Apeit Wallet</h2></div>
 <p style="font-size:.875rem;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:1.25rem">
 The link shown to users when they need to get an Apeit Wallet. Users are directed here when they have no wallet address connected.
 </p>
 <div class="a-form-group">
 <label>Apeit Wallet URL</label>
 <input type="url" name="apeitWalletUrl" class="a-input" value="<%= settings.apeitWalletUrl %>" placeholder="https://apeitwallet.io" required>
 </div>
 <div style="padding:.875rem 1rem;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(251,191,36,.06);border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.2);font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--text-3)">
 <i class="fas fa-circle-info" style="color:#fbbf24;margin-right:.4rem"></i>
 Users are warned to use their <strong style="color:var(--text-2)">Solana USDC address</strong> from Apeit Wallet when submitting withdrawal requests.
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- ── Withdrawal Settings ── -->
 <div class="a-card" style="animation-delay:60ms">
 <div class="a-card-header"><h2><i class="fas fa-arrow-up-from-bracket"></i> Withdrawal Settings</h2></div>

 <div class="a-form-group">
 <label>Minimum Withdrawal Amount ($)</label>
 <input type="number" name="withdrawalMin" class="a-input" value="<%= settings.withdrawalMin %>" min="1" step="0.01" required>
 <small style="color:var(--text-3)">Users cannot withdraw less than this amount.</small>
 </div>

 <div style="margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:.875rem;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--text)">Fee Tiers</div>
 <p style="font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:1.125rem">Three tiers based on withdrawal amount. The fee is deducted from the user's withdrawal.</p>

 <!-- Tier 1 -->
 <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">
 <div style="font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:.75rem">Tier 1 — Small Withdrawals</div>
 <div class="a-form-row" style="margin-bottom:0">
 <div class="a-form-group" style="margin-bottom:0">
 <label>Amount Under ($)</label>
 <input type="number" name="feeTierSmallUpTo" class="a-input" value="<%= settings.feeTierSmallUpTo %>" min="1" step="0.01">
 </div>
 <div class="a-form-group" style="margin-bottom:0">
 <label>Fee ($)</label>
 <input type="number" name="feeTierSmall" class="a-input" value="<%= settings.feeTierSmall %>" min="0" step="0.01">
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Tier 2 -->
 <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">
 <div style="font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;color:#fbbf24;margin-bottom:.75rem">Tier 2 — Medium Withdrawals</div>
 <div class="a-form-row" style="margin-bottom:0">
 <div class="a-form-group" style="margin-bottom:0">
 <label>Amount Up To ($)</label>
 <input type="number" name="feeTierMediumUpTo" class="a-input" value="<%= settings.feeTierMediumUpTo %>" min="1" step="0.01">
 </div>
 <div class="a-form-group" style="margin-bottom:0">
 <label>Fee ($)</label>
 <input type="number" name="feeTierMedium" class="a-input" value="<%= settings.feeTierMedium %>" min="0" step="0.01">
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Tier 3 -->
 <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem">
 <div style="font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;color:#fb923c;margin-bottom:.75rem">Tier 3 — Large Withdrawals (above Tier 2 threshold)</div>
 <div class="a-form-group" style="margin-bottom:0">
 <label>Fee ($)</label>
 <input type="number" name="feeTierLarge" class="a-input" value="<%= settings.feeTierLarge %>" min="0" step="0.01">
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Preview -->
 <div style="padding:.875rem 1rem;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(94,194,19,.04);border:1px solid rgba(94,194,19,.15);font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--text-3)">
 <i class="fas fa-eye" style="color:var(--green);margin-right:.4rem"></i>
 <strong style="color:var(--text-2)">Preview:</strong>
 Under $<%= settings.feeTierSmallUpTo %> → $<%= settings.feeTierSmall.toFixed(2) %> fee &nbsp;|&nbsp;
 $<%= settings.feeTierSmallUpTo %>–$<%= settings.feeTierMediumUpTo %> → $<%= settings.feeTierMedium.toFixed(2) %> fee &nbsp;|&nbsp;
 Over $<%= settings.feeTierMediumUpTo %> → $<%= settings.feeTierLarge.toFixed(2) %> fee
 </div>
 </div>

 <button type="submit" class="a-btn a-btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;padding:1rem">
 <i class="fas fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save All Settings
 </button>
 </form>
 </div>
</div>
<%- include('../../partials/whatsapp-float') %>
</body>
</html>
